OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GLinton Stephens with an afternoon
OL,6,     Gof great concert performances
OL,7,     Gincluding Beethoven's Pastoral
OL,8,     GSymphony with Renaud Capucon and
OL,9,     GSaint-Saens's Egyptian-inspired
OL,10,     Gpiano concerto.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Schutz
OL,12,     GDonald Macleod sees Schutz endure
OL,13,     Gthe death of his wife, after only
OL,14,     Gsix years of marriage, and
OL,15,     Gexplores the music he composed to
OL,16,     Gmark her parting.
OL,17,G1700FIn Tune
OL,18,     GPetroc Trelawny welcomes
OL,19,     Gviolinist Jennifer Pike and
OL,20,     Gsoprano Danielle de Niese to the
OL,21,     Gstudio, as they both perform live
OL,22,     Gin 80A.
